-- FLL-Naturteich · coverage wave block 3a (2026-09-29): fields the guideline prints limits for but the worksheets never asked.
-- 13 fields on FLLNT-06/-07/-11 + equation FLLNT-11-D3 (feed share of the total water volume).
-- Every verification_quote read on the rendered PDF in-session 2026-09-29 (VA); printed page in source_anchor (PDF page = printed + 3).
-- SAFETY: all new fields is_required = false; no gate, value or severity changes here — those are block 3b (sign-off).
